// here since the move to Google Sheets. A column added here appears in its tab on the next scripts/sheets-setup.mjs
// run (add new columns at the end of a table, so existing rows keep their cells).
// Since then: documents.file_ref and file_sha256 (uploaded files are kept on the n8n server, not in a cell);
// ramadan_assessments (24_ramadan.js); glucose_readings_archive (readings moved there by fn_run_retention);
